r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Granville County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in October to November and 46% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 36% of normal on the middle of the grids, and April to May at 47%.</p>"}
